Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: The status of the trial is that we will be proceeding, or continuing rather, with the cross-examination of the counsel-correspondent. Clerk of court is directed to kindly get the witness and have him situate himself before the witness stand for the cross of the counsel-correspondent. Good afternoon,

16
