Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Thank you, sir. Good afternoon. Counsel for respondent may proceed when you're ready, sir.

20
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:37,480
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: Your Honor, considering the interpolations yesterday by the senator judges, and to give time also for more interpolations today, if any, we'll just go over several cross-points, Your Honor.

21
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,800
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: You may proceed, sir.

22
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:52,280
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: And as instructed by the Chair yesterday, the interjections and interventions of Senator Judges shall be after the cross, redirect, and recross, if any. You may proceed, sir.

