47
00:13:03,470 --> 00:13:14,570
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: The continuing objection of Council Lead Prosecutor is duly noted in regard to the line and words used by Council Correspondent. Council Correspondent may proceed.

48
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:15,800
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: All right.

49
00:13:17,610 --> 00:13:26,030
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: So going back, this was one of the documents that you submitted by virtue of the Subpoena du Sisteko, correct? AO number 11.

50
00:13:26,450 --> 00:13:27,130
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Yes.

51
