Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: In fact, AO No. 11 was first mentioned in public during that April 29, 2026 hearing, correct?

52
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:42,870
Atty. Melvin Matibag: In that hearing, yes. But I never—I cannot recall if it had been made public before.

53
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:45,310
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: All right. But you mentioned it in that hearing.

54
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:47,670
Atty. Melvin Matibag: I think it was mentioned. Yes, sir.

55
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:53,910
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: Now, AO 11 pertains to the creation of a special task force. Is it not?

56
