Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: to the life of the President constitute a grave offense with far-reaching implications on national stability, public safety, and the continuity of government. Do you confirm this?

59
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:17,140
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: you confirm this? Sir,

60
