01:43:39,200 --> 01:44:07,320
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Ngayon, bilang pakiusap po sa prosecution, sana ay maiwasan natin ang pagbibigay ng witness na may kasong perjury. Hindi na po ito si Lascañas. Ang sinasabi ko po ay iyong dalawang mahal nating witness, si Atty. Jeremy Lotoc at si NBI Agent Calilung, na sa mga oras na ito ay may kasong hinaharap na perjury. Pwede po bang iwasan natin na may mga ganito tayong witness para ang—

629
01:44:09,140 --> 01:44:14,580
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: nasasakdal po kasi dito ay ibinoto ng 32 million na tao.

630
01:44:17,350 --> 01:44:36,170
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Sana po aming mga mahal na kaibigan sa prosecution ay isipin nating mabuti bago po tayo magbigay ng mga witness na may perjury na kaso o nagkaroon po kami ng dahilan na

631
01:44:37,900 --> 01:44:41,970
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Nagkaroon po kami ng dahilan na gumawa ng amendment na itong perjury ay amendahan.

632
01:44:43,270 --> 01:44:44,270
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Pwede po ba iyon?

633
01:44:44,550 --> 01:45:23,090
Atty. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: Your Honor, with all due respect, I would like to take exception to the question and manifestation of the Honorable Senator-Judge Robin Padilla. First of all, we were able to verify already that there are no cases pending against the prosecution witnesses. In addition, Your Honor, and only to respond to the concern of the Honorable Senator-Judge, ang conviction po ay hindi ground for disqualification unless it is final and unless it is punishable by more than one year and that the crime constitutes moral turpitude.

634
01:45:25,000 --> 01:45:44,640
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Alam ninyo po, napakaganda po ng inyong sagot. Sana hindi one-sided ang ating prosecution. Kasi alam ninyo, pag kayo ang pabor sa inyo—alam ninyo, bawal po ang ginagawa.

635
01:45:44,660 --> 01:45:46,500
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Kindly maintain order within the court.

636
01:45:46,500 --> 01:45:50,400
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Presiding Officer, bawal po ang ginagawa nitong nasa harap natin, nagko-comment.

637
01:45:50,400 --> 01:46:00,780
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Kindly maintain order in the court. The Sergeant-at-Arms, by authority of the Senate President, is directed to kindly maintain order in the court.

638
01:46:00,960 --> 01:46:06,800
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Hindi po sila allowed mag-ingay. Korte po ito.

639
01:46:09,510 --> 01:46:15,450
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Thank you. You may proceed, Senator-Judge Padilla. Who was speaking? Ako po. You may proceed, Senator-Judge Padilla.

640
01:46:15,460 --> 01:46:16,420
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: I was interrupted.

641
01:46:17,420 --> 01:46:18,560
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: With your apologies.

642
01:46:20,390 --> 01:46:38,150
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: So, ibig niyo pong sabihin, yung mga senator judges dito ngayon na humaharap sa kaso na hindi po pinapayagan ng ombudsman at hindi pa rin sila guilty, ano pong ibig niyo sabihin?

643
01:46:39,110 --> 01:46:44,310
Atty. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: Your Honor, with all due respect, ang question niyo po kanina ay kaugnay ng pagtistigo,

644
01:46:44,900 --> 01:46:46,600
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: referring

645
01:46:46,600 --> 01:46:50,040
Atty. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: to the witnesses of the prosecution, Your Honor.

646
01:46:50,180 --> 01:47:00,980
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Ang usapan po, are you all guilty or not guilty? Okay? So, tatanong na po ako ng bago. Pwede po ba?

647
01:47:01,140 --> 01:47:09,970
Atty. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: May I be clarified, Your Honor, on your last question about the senator? You said are facing cases?

648
01:47:12,110 --> 01:47:18,730
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Alam niyo po, malinaw na po yung sinabi ko and wala po kayong karapatan magtanong ng Sen. Judge. I

649
01:47:18,730 --> 01:47:30,840
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: think Sen. Judge Padilla was making a manifestation and not posing a question to the lead prosecutor in relation to our two colleagues. You may proceed, Sen. Judge Padilla. Maraming

650
01:47:30,840 --> 01:47:41,940
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: salamat po, Gilong Tagapamahalang Hukom. Pwede na po ba tayong mag-advance ng katalungan?

651
01:47:42,820 --> 01:47:43,820
Atty. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: Yes, Your Honor.

652
01:47:44,040 --> 01:47:44,360
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Apo.

653
01:47:45,940 --> 01:47:52,070
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Yung pong sinasabi ninyo, bakit niyo po nababanggit ang ICC dito?

654
01:47:53,580 --> 01:47:59,690
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Ano po ang kinalaman ng ICC dito sa ating pagdinig?

655
01:47:59,930 --> 01:48:32,300
Atty. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: With all due respect, Honorable Senator-Judge Robin Padilla, kagaya po nang nabanggit ko na, at marahil panglima nang banggit ng Presiding Officer, nabanggit po ang ICC kaugnay ng affidavit ni Lascañas, na ipinrisinta po ng prosecution bilang bahagi lamang ng testimonya ng witness at bilang bahagi ng naging imbestigasyon ng Special Task Force ng NBI. Maraming salamat po.

656
01:48:32,440 --> 01:48:37,100
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Senator-Judge Padilla will please wind up. You can avail of a second round if you wish.

657
01:48:37,340 --> 01:48:43,910
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Opo, opo. Maraming salamat po. Sa ibig pong sabihin, malinaw na kanina sinabi natin na—

658
01:48:43,910 --> 01:48:50,810
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: hindi siya... With the permission of Senator Judge and indulgence of Senator Judge Padilla, what is the pleasure of Senator Judge Rafi Tulfo?

659
01:48:51,950 --> 01:49:29,860
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Walang mic kay Senator Padilla. Bakit pag sa kabila pinapayagan sila 5-10 minutes, bakit pag sa amin, sa majority, kinakat agad ni-remind pagdating ng bago, pagdating ng 2 minutes? I think nakakalata na kami. So dapat pag sinabing two minutes, two minutes. Pag sa amin sa majority, pag two minutes, pinipindot ng pinipindot nito. Dalawa, tatlong beses. Totoo yan. Pero pag sa minority, umabot na ng five minutes, ten minutes. At meron akong record dyan. Pinapayagan. Why? Thank you.

660
01:49:32,530 --> 01:49:58,510
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Comments of Senator-Judge Raffy Tulfo are recognized. However, the Chair would like to point out that in the Impeachment Court, there is no majority nor minority. We are all Senator-Judges. And Senator Lacson earlier requested also additional time to finish his point, which the Chair allowed. That's why the Chair reminded Senator-Judge Padilla to wind up because his time already lapsed.

661
01:49:58,510 --> 01:50:39,420
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Kaya nga, Mr. Presiding Officer, I'm sorry, I do have a lot of respect in you. Yung sa akin lang, kahit na sino senador, kapag—

662
01:50:39,560 --> 01:51:02,370
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: The Clerk of Court is instructed to kindly relay to the bell ringer to kindly be consistent in doing the reminder. Polite reminder to the senator judges with respect to the time allotted. Senator Judge

663
01:51:02,370 --> 01:52:20,880
Sen. Alan Peter Cayetano: I take the comments of Senator Tulfo in order. I respect your opinion. But just to put on record, as you said, Senator Lacson a while ago asked for more time—binigay, walang bell 'yon. Yesterday, dalawang bell sa akin, dalawa o tatlo? Dalawa lang ang bilang ko. And maybe the solution is that after the first, isang bell na lang. Pero kasi from the start of the impeachment trial, we asked the Presiding Officer, at sabi mo nga, liberality, because then if not, if we can't ask questions, baka magkaroon ng motion or mas lalong tatagal. Maybe you've been doing it naman, but 'yun nga, just ask to wrap up. But konti— we all want to get back to work. There's so much that we want to do. At least, wala ngang majority-minority, but at least walang threat ng kaso sa majority. Kami, magsalita dito, parang may sword sa aming nakatutok. So konting pagbibigay din sa amin ng liberality sa pagtatanong. But in accordance with the rules, tama naman po 'yung sinabi ni Senator Tulfo.

664
01:52:21,050 --> 01:52:32,630
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: The Presiding Officer shall take in advisement the points raised by Senator-Judge Raffy Tulfo as well as the points raised by Senator-Judge Alan. And in that spirit, kindly wind up, Senator-Judge Padilla.

665
01:52:33,250 --> 01:52:51,300
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Ginoong tagapamahalang hukom, nais lamang pong sagutin ang ating kaibigan na si Senator Raffy Tulfo. Sandali lang po, kaibigan, mas mahaba kasi iyong sagot din nung ating prosecution. Ako po ay nagtatanong lamang ng oo ba o hindi. Pasensya na po.

666
01:52:52,160 --> 01:52:55,660
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Kindly wind up, Sen. Judge Padilla, but you're gonna bail off the second round if there's one.

667
01:52:57,910 --> 01:53:07,130
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Tatalon na po ako. Dito na po ako sa aking kaibigan. Maraming salamat po, kaibigan. Sa akin pong kaibigan, kay Atty. Matibag, mahal na saksi.

668
01:53:09,150 --> 01:53:16,580
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Mabilis lang po ito. Ako po ay napunta sa PDP lamang dahil po sa inyo?

669
01:53:17,730 --> 01:53:19,130
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Tama po. Opo.

670
01:53:19,370 --> 01:53:21,330
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Kayo po ang kumumbinsi sa akin?

671
01:53:21,670 --> 01:53:22,370
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Tama po.

672
01:53:22,470 --> 01:53:23,650
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Campaign manager n'yo pa po.

673
01:53:23,930 --> 01:53:24,210
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Opo.

674
01:53:24,310 --> 01:53:28,510
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: At masasabi po natin na isa kayo sa nagpa number one po sa akin?

675
01:53:28,790 --> 01:53:31,850
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Tama po. Sa lugar po namin number one po kayo. Opo.

676
01:53:32,690 --> 01:53:44,880
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Atty. Matibag, sumama po ako sa inyo dahil alam ko na isa po kayo sa arkitekto ng pagkapanalo ni President Rodrigo Roa Duterte. Tama po ba?

677
01:53:45,300 --> 01:53:52,380
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Hindi po, sapagkat noong 2016 ako po ay campaign manager ng Region IV-A ni Secretary Mar Roxas po.

678
01:53:52,740 --> 01:53:57,960
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Ayun. So hindi po kayo connected noong panahon na iyon kay Pangulong Rodrigo Roa Duterte?

679
01:53:58,240 --> 01:53:58,720
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Hindi po.

680
01:53:58,900 --> 01:54:19,870
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Opo. Kung kayo po ay nagtatrabaho sa mga iba't ibang politiko, kaya po ba ay matatawag na political analyst o political—ano pang tawag po doon—'yung mga nagsasagawa, nagpapatakbo ng politika ng bawat politiko?

681
01:54:20,350 --> 01:54:27,770
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Well, maaari pong matawag na tayo ay tumutulong sa ating pinaniniwalaan na kung sino po ang dapat manungkulan sa ating bayan.

682
01:54:27,930 --> 01:54:32,870
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Opo. Ibig pong sabihin, pwede po kayong gumawa ng isang kandidato at manalo?

683
01:54:34,480 --> 01:54:40,760
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Magkatulog lang po sapagkat ang paniwala ko po hindi naman po isang tao lalo na ako ang magpapanalo ng isang kandidato.

684
01:54:41,040 --> 01:54:52,620
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Opo. So ngayon po masasabi po natin na pwede po kayong magtrabaho bilang isang political operator?

685
01:54:54,710 --> 01:55:06,230
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Ano po bang konteksto ng political operator? Ang ibig po sabihin... Ako po ay nasasama siya isang political party noon so tumutulong po tayong maipanalo ang isang kandidato ng political party.

686
01:55:09,320 --> 01:55:14,960
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Ano po ba ang trabaho ng political operator sa Pilipinas? Pwede ding gumawa? Pwede ding sumira?

687
01:55:15,780 --> 01:55:24,000
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Well, ang political operator to be successful kailangan po yung kanyang sasamahan ay magtagumpay ang kanyang pong laban at advokasiya.

688
01:55:24,380 --> 01:55:27,300
Sen. Robinhood “Robin” Padilla: Okay. 'Yun lang po. Maraming salamat po, kaibigang attorney.

689
01:55:27,560 --> 01:55:32,600
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Thank you, Senator-Judge Padilla. The Senate President is recognized for his interjection.

690
01:55:32,820 --> 01:55:49,460
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Tutuloy ko lang po 'yung mga katanungan ng mga kasamahan natin kanina. Mr. Witness, balikan ko po 'yung persons of interest. Itong persons of interest, ito 'yung nakausap n'yong actual killer?

691
01:55:50,900 --> 01:55:55,940
Atty. Melvin Matibag: 'Yung persons of interest po can be characterized na merong nakausap.

692
01:55:56,020 --> 01:55:59,920
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero 'yung kausap n'yo, ito ba 'yung actual na nakontrata?

693
01:56:00,160 --> 01:56:19,620
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Well, persons of interest 'yun nga po. Ang sinasabi nga po natin, ito 'yung maaaring makapagturo. Hindi pa po natin nakausap ito lahat. Ang sinasabi ko po kanina, doon sa atin pong mga nakilala, meron na pong mga pamilya na gustong makipag-usap sa atin at magbigay ng impormasyon. Katunayan, nakakausap na po.

694
01:56:19,740 --> 01:56:22,700
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So ito, hindi ito 'yung actual na nakontrata?

695
01:56:22,940 --> 01:56:26,560
Atty. Melvin Matibag: 'Yun po 'yung dumadaan pa po sa proseso ng amin pong pag-iimbestiga.

696
01:56:27,300 --> 01:56:33,680
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Gusto ko lang, by process of elimination, 'yung nakausap n'yo is hindi pa actual na nakontrata?

697
01:56:33,720 --> 01:56:40,620
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Hindi pa po natin masiguro doon po sa natitirang numero kung ang isa doon ay siya talagang actual na nakontrata o grupo po.

698
01:56:40,800 --> 01:56:43,680
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: 'Yung iba, nasabi n'yo, may iba rin ba kayong nakakausap pa?

699
01:56:43,880 --> 01:56:48,560
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Tama po. 'Yung iba naman ay makakapagturo kung sino 'yung nakontrata.

700
01:56:49,520 --> 01:56:50,000
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tama po iyon?

701
01:56:50,320 --> 01:56:50,990
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Tama.

702
01:56:51,200 --> 01:57:02,880
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: At itong mga taong makakapagturo, ano po 'yung mga ebidensya na puwede ninyong sabihin na credible itong mga taong ito?

703
01:57:03,060 --> 01:57:09,880
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Doon na po pumapasok 'yung mga intelligence report po sa amin, using our tools, the human intel and the officer's intel.

704
01:57:10,040 --> 01:57:18,460
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Bigyan lang ninyo kami ng concrete example na ito ay credible, puwedeng paniwalaan na magtuturo. Just give us an example.

705
01:57:19,070 --> 01:57:29,830
Atty. Melvin Matibag: So yung ginagamit po namin dito na human intel ay yung mga dati na rin po namin in four months na nasa ground po na nakakakuha po ng mga intelligence na ipinapasa po sa amin.

706
01:57:29,990 --> 01:57:32,070
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So base to sa human intelligence. Human

707
01:57:32,070 --> 01:57:32,890
Atty. Melvin Matibag: intel po. Pero

708
01:57:32,890 --> 01:57:36,410
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: pwede rin mangyayari na itong purse of interest wala rin kalalabasan.

709
01:57:37,210 --> 01:57:40,910
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Posible po yun. Nangyayari po yan sa mga kaso po na So

710
01:57:40,910 --> 01:57:46,790
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: yung nasabi niyo kahapong three to six months. Pwede rin after six months, zero. Walang kalalabasan.

711
01:57:46,910 --> 01:58:06,490
Atty. Melvin Matibag: h dito po namin ibinabase na mukhang lalabas po ang positibong resulta po.

712
01:58:06,580 --> 01:58:10,460
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So, in other words, 'yung probability, mataas?

713
01:58:10,460 --> 01:58:10,960
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Mataas po.

714
01:58:11,200 --> 01:58:14,860
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Gano'ng kataas? Bigyan n'yo kami ng more or less lang, in your own opinion.

715
01:58:15,300 --> 01:58:19,960
Atty. Melvin Matibag: From the scale of 1 to 10, nandoon po tayo ngayon sa 6 to 7 po.

716
01:58:20,080 --> 01:58:26,320
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Six to seven na merong kalalabasan na magtuturong may nakontrata?

717
01:58:26,540 --> 01:58:27,140
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Tama po.

718
01:58:27,800 --> 01:58:36,760
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Babalikan ko lang 'yung statement n'yo na nakakausap n'yo parati, or na-mention n'yo 'yung Vice President Security Group.

719
01:58:37,400 --> 01:58:40,720
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Kasama po 'yun sa isinama natin na pag-aaral po, pag-iimbestiga.

720
01:58:40,720 --> 01:59:02,240
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Correct. Kasama ba sila sa persons of interest, itong Vice President Security Group? Kasi nabanggit n'yo ngayon, kasama kahapon, na madali silang tawagin, nandoon lahat. Kasama ba sila dito sa persons of interest ninyo? Kung puwede ninyong sabihin—I know you're investigating—kung puwede lang sabihin.

721
01:59:03,880 --> 01:59:06,500
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Actually, meron pong personalidad na kasama doon.

722
01:59:06,590 --> 01:59:14,190
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Merong kasama doon. But naiintindihan ko na itong VP security group is also members of the government.

723
01:59:14,830 --> 01:59:22,970
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Yun nga po yung sinasabi ko that there are, actually doon po sa aming nanarod down, there are men in uniform who is in active service.

724
01:59:23,090 --> 01:59:26,710
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Puwede rin palitan ng Executive at any given time. Tama?

725
01:59:26,870 --> 01:59:27,530
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Tama po.

726
01:59:27,670 --> 01:59:38,460
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So paano, kung pwede silang palitan, paano nagkakaroon, ba doon sila nagiging persons of interest na merong Potentially, manggaling sa kanila itong pagkakontrata.

727
01:59:38,660 --> 01:59:58,800
Atty. Melvin Matibag: 'Yun po 'yung precisely the reason na ayaw po natin na 'yung term na tinatawag na masunog 'yung ating lead na kinukuha. Baka po makaapekto pag nagkaroon po ng mga sudden na galawan. So right now, 'yung tao po nating sinusundan, at para madali rin po sa aming pag-monitor and surveillance, mas maigi po na nakapirmis po.

728
01:59:59,520 --> 02:00:01,480
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Sige. Maraming salamat, Ginoong Testigo.

729
02:00:01,520 --> 02:00:02,040
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Salamat po.

730
02:00:02,040 --> 02:00:17,910
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Thank you, Mr. Senate President. Senator-Judge Pangilinan is recognized for his interjections; thereafter, Senator-Judge Go; thereafter, Senator-Judge Hontiveros. Senator-Judge Pangilinan, you have two minutes. You may proceed when you're ready, sir.

731
02:00:17,920 --> 02:01:01,220
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Maraming salamat, Mr. Presiding Officer. Ginoong witness, nabanggit ng ilang testigo bago sa inyo, si Atty. Lotoc, na in so many words, above his pay grade, 'yung usapin ng interagency coordination. At sabi pa niya, maaaring ang director mismo, former director or current director, ang makapagsasabi niyan. Nung sinabi ninyong may national security threat, nakipag-ugnayan ba ang NBI sa iba pang mga ahensya ng pamahalaan?

732
02:01:01,460 --> 02:01:03,540
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Meron po kaming tuloy-tuloy na ugnayan.

733
02:01:03,700 --> 02:01:10,860
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: At sino-sino ang mga ahensya o alin dito sa mga ahensya ng pamalan ang nakipag-ugnayan kayo?

734
02:01:11,300 --> 02:01:33,940
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Actually po, sinasabi nga natin meron po kasing security cluster kung saan po natatalakay yung mga kailangan po pag-usapan. So sa ngayon po, Through the Office of the Executive Secretary, meron po akong mga pakikipag-usap dun po sa military units din po natin. If you will not mind, I will not mention the exact military

735
02:01:33,940 --> 02:01:45,220
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: unit po. So there have been inter-agency coordination to assess and to address itong kinukonsideran ninyong national security threat?

736
02:01:45,520 --> 02:01:46,640
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Totoo po yan. Yes po.

737
02:01:46,760 --> 02:02:12,700
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Okay. Dun sa usapin ng Pag iimbesigan ninyo naman, nasabi ninyong may narinig kayong mga banta na panood ninyo, meron ba kayong na-monitor na nagbanta naman ang ating Pangulo bilang pag-retaliate doon sa nasabing banta ni Vice President?

738
02:02:13,680 --> 02:02:16,500
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Ibig sabihin po, banta ng Pangulo sa Vice President?

739
02:02:16,740 --> 02:02:18,180
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Yes. Meron ba kayong na-monitor?

740
02:02:18,420 --> 02:02:18,860
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Wala po.

741
02:02:19,480 --> 02:02:23,140
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Kung meron man, hypothetically, tama ba yun?

742
02:02:23,720 --> 02:02:27,460
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Well, kailangan pong imbestigahan din kung meron pong ganung bantang.

743
02:02:27,500 --> 02:02:43,880
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: In other words, would you consider in a hypothetical situation, revenge as justified? If there is a threat to the President, he decides, he likewise publicly threatens whoever, not necessarily the Vice President, whoever.

744
02:02:44,410 --> 02:02:59,290
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Ito ay hindi tama sa pagkat hindi naman po ito isang justifying or exempting na circumstance pagka nangyari po yung pagbabanta. Lalong lalo na po kung matas na opisyal, hindi po pwedeng maging batayan ang kanyang paghihiganti para magbanta po.

745
